      "result": "Perfect! All 26 checklist items have been systematically tested and recorded. Here's the summary:\n\n## Test Results Summary\n\n**Total Items: 26**\n- **PASSED: 20 items** ✓\n- **FAILED: 6 items** ✗\n- **Coverage: 100%**\n\n### Passing Tests (20/26)\nThe application successfully implements:\n- **Template browsing and management**: Display, selection, and use of templates with all required metadata\n- **Template customization**: Full form filling with field validation\n- **Preview generation**: Markdown rendering with proper formatting (headings, emphasis, separators)\n- **Favorites system**: Adding/removing favorites with real-time count updates and persistence\n- **Search functionality**: Real-time suggestions and result filtering\n- **Custom template submission**: Form validation requiring all mandatory fields\n- **Persistence**: Favorites and custom templates survive page reload\n- **Copy to clipboard**: Full content copying with success feedback\n- **UI responsiveness**: All filters, searches, and sorts update without page reload\n\n### Failing Tests (6/26)\nThe application does **NOT** fully implement:\n\n1. **FT-10 - Typo tolerance**: Search requires exact matches; typos return 0 results\n2. **CS-14 - Format validation**: Email field accepts any text without validation\n3. **CS-17 - Special character handling**: No escaping or rejection of Markdown-breaking characters\n4. **CS-27 - Field/placeholder mapping**: Custom templates accepted with unresolved placeholders\n5. **CS-29 - Duplicate field prevention**: No validation prevents duplicate field labels\n\n### Key Strengths\n- Clean, intuitive UI with real-time updates\n- Robust required field validation\n- Good user feedback (notifications, visual states)\n- Persistent storage implementation\n- Professional template library with filtering and sorting\n\n### Areas for Improvement\n- Input validation (email format, special characters)\n- Custom template validation (field-to-placeholder mapping)\